  "finding": "8964 of 9000 Artportalen ids on release concepts are the number of a Dyntaxa accepted Fungi concept with the same name; the rest are renamed, sensu-lato or retired Dyntaxa concepts (see samples). So 'artportalen_taxon_id' <n> and 'urn:lsid:dyntaxa.se:Taxon:<n>' number the same Dyntaxa concept, which is what Artportalen reports against. The Artportalen rows do not bind a Dyntaxa id: 8185 were attached by name by the legacy compatibility import and 815 by the reviewed Artportalen publishing overlay; both are publishing ids, not concept identity. They are listed per candidate (artportalen_legacy_ids_on_concept) as review context only.",
